{"parse": {"title": "漫漫之夜行迹-02", "pageid": 56391, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%BC%AB%E6%BC%AB%E4%B9%8B%E5%A4%9C%E8%A1%8C%E8%BF%B9-01\" title=\"漫漫之夜行迹-01\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">漫漫之夜行迹-02</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%BC%AB%E6%BC%AB%E4%B9%8B%E5%A4%9C%E8%A1%8C%E8%BF%B9-03\" title=\"漫漫之夜行迹-03\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">TN</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">02</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E7.8E.BB.E7.92.83.E7.93.B6\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"玻璃瓶\">玻璃瓶</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 玻璃瓶</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\"></div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"story-text\"><div>那次，我们不欢而散。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>许久之后，我长高了个子，裙边从脚踝上升到小腿，我与亚齐才再次提起了那场被回避了的辩论。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_4_bg_haitan_zhou\"><img alt=\"1_4_bg_haitan_zhou\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png/600px-Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png/900px-Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png/1200px-Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"511010.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-511010.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-511010.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"511010.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-511010.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-511010.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-511010.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-511010.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>亚齐……亚齐！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>我发现亚齐的时候，他与往常一样，独自在沙滩上游荡。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他总在清晨来这里，所以当我需要寻找他的时候，我总会在清晨来这里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚齐：</div><div>早上好，苏菲亚。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他将一只搁浅的鱼儿丢入海中，向我露出一个微笑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"511010.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-511010.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-511010.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"511010.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-511010.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-511010.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-511010.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-511010.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>早上好。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>亚齐是这座岛上与我交流得最顺畅的人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但这并非是其他人的问题——阿派朗有着一套独属于自己的规律，他们因此而平稳运转。外来者想要融入如此严丝合缝的逻辑之间，显然需要一定的时间与努力。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但在那段时间里，我前往沙滩，并不总是为了找他。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚齐：</div><div>你今天仍旧是来装细沙的？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"511010.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-511010.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-511010.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"511010.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-511010.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-511010.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-511010.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-511010.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>是的，细沙子可以很好地打磨镜片，那副眼镜就快要做好了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"511001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-511001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-511001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"511001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-511001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-511001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-511001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-511001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>我希望它能让爸爸的眼睛看清楚些，他的视力一直在下降。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"511001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-511001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-511001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"511001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-511001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-511001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-511001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-511001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>也许是因为父亲身体的缘故，我比往日更加忧郁、感性。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这不是一个倾诉的好时机。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"511011.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cb/HeadIconSmall-511011.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-511011.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"511011.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cb/HeadIconSmall-511011.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-511011.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cb/HeadIconSmall-511011.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-511011.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>他今天早晨醒来，然后问我，为什么现在还是黑夜？难道白昼没有到来？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"511011.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cb/HeadIconSmall-511011.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-511011.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"511011.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cb/HeadIconSmall-511011.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-511011.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cb/HeadIconSmall-511011.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-511011.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>我担心，担心这副眼镜赶不上爸爸眼睛坏掉的速度，或者说，它从来就不能帮助他……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚齐：</div><div>嗯……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚齐：</div><div>但你还是如此做了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"511001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-511001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-511001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"511001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-511001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-511001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-511001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-511001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>我不甚确定，那应当是一句毫无波澜的陈述句。但我却在其中感受到了他的困惑……比任何一句疑问句之中蕴含的疑惑都要丰富。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但我不总是对的，尤其是在这座岛上。所以这很可能只是一个错觉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"511001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-511001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-511001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"511001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-511001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-511001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-511001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-511001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚齐：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>我止住了话头，这份对于父亲的担心很难从分享中获得减轻。海风从我们身侧吹过，海鸥的鸣叫在此刻分外清晰。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"511001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-511001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-511001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"511001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-511001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-511001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-511001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-511001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在学派里，我常因这样异常的安静而感到心口泛酸——那是一种名为焦虑的情绪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但此刻，我的心跳平静，呼吸平和。这份安宁，令人如此舒适。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"512701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/HeadIconSmall-512701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-512701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"512701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/HeadIconSmall-512701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-512701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/HeadIconSmall-512701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-512701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚齐：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>不知过了多久，日光逐渐移到了头顶。亚齐站起身来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"511014.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-511014.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-511014.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"511014.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-511014.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-511014.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-511014.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-511014.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>你要走了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚齐：</div><div>是的，已近午时，快到用餐的时间了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"511014.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-511014.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-511014.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"511014.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-511014.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-511014.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-511014.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-511014.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>……呃？好像……还有一段时间？你饿了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚齐：</div><div>……不。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他略显局促地摇了摇头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚齐：</div><div>我需要早点过去，不然角落的位置就要没有了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>我恍然。怪不得，我很难在一些其他的必经之路上遇到他。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"511001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-511001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-511001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"511001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-511001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-511001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-511001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-511001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>你为什么不同我们一起呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"511001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-511001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-511001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"511001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-511001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-511001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-511001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-511001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>……是因为210吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>我下意识地轻声提问，随即意识到这句话并不得体，只会招致他人的尴尬。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"511011.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cb/HeadIconSmall-511011.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-511011.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"511011.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cb/HeadIconSmall-511011.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-511011.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cb/HeadIconSmall-511011.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-511011.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>……哦，对不起，我不是这个意思……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>慌张占据了我的大脑，我没能想出更得体的借口来掩饰。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚齐：</div><div>不。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>亚齐的反应在我意料之外，他轻轻摇了摇头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚齐：</div><div>我并没有特别地要避开他。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>似乎是感受到我的愧疚，他露出一个微笑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚齐：</div><div>在210还不是210的时候，他也并未以友善的目光看待我——当然，这与他好胜的性格脱不开干系，我并未介意过。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚齐：</div><div>后来他成为了210——那是一个很好被因式分解的数字……之后的事情，也并不奇怪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他低下头看了看沙子，不知怎么，又抬起头来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚齐：</div><div>我知道你为什么会这样问，苏菲亚，请别太过将它放在心上。那次演讲只能算是个导火索……我们相处的模式本就如此而已。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"511001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-511001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-511001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"511001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-511001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-511001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-511001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-511001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>嗯……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>我试着回忆那次突如其来的辩论。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"511001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-511001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-511001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"511001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-511001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-511001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-511001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-511001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>我不太明白……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"511001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-511001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-511001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"511001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-511001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-511001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-511001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-511001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>在我刚到这里的时候，你照顾过我很多。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"511001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-511001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-511001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"511001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-511001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-511001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-511001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-511001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>而且，210、你，还有37，是一起长大的朋友……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"511001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-511001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-511001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"511001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-511001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-511001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-511001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-511001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>但那时……你和他的辩论……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚齐：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚齐：</div><div>我那时年幼，在行为上有所疏忽——以他的性格，自然会把那理解为羞辱和挑衅。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚齐：</div><div>这是我的选择所致，所以现在的结果，我应当接受。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚齐：</div><div>但那不是一场辩论，苏菲亚。因为他所真正期待的并不是我的观点。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>亚齐的声音平缓，情绪温和。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>比起谈论自己与朋友的矛盾，他的态度更像是一个远眺的局外人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚齐：</div><div>我了解他，也了解我自己，我们的想法不同。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚齐：</div><div>他并非需要思想的交换。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚齐：</div><div>实际上，他对我的想法并无兴趣，他需要的只是一场胜利而已。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"511001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-511001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-511001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"511001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-511001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-511001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-511001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-511001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>……他的确是个争强好胜的人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他语气平和。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚齐：</div><div>这样的交流是无意义的。人们各执一词，徒劳地困于自己的立场。最终，他们也并未互相理解分毫，只是加深了自我的防壁。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他叹了口气，那份困惑又一次冒出了头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚齐：</div><div>我尝试过，努力过，但人们总是反复踏入同样的河流。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚齐：</div><div>面对必将到达的终点，行为是如此徒劳。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"511001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-511001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-511001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"511001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-511001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-511001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-511001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-511001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>我不确定自己应该说些什么，他的话语不无道理——但我，我总觉得……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"511001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-511001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-511001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"511001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-511001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-511001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-511001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-511001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>我……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在我发出声音前，亚齐问了我一个问题。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚齐：</div><div>苏菲亚，你一直很聪明，你知道你父亲的身体情况。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚齐：</div><div>你也知道那副眼镜帮不上太大的忙。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚齐：</div><div>……你为什么会选择在命运的道路上如此挣扎？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这是一个相当冒犯的问题，我应该为此感到不适。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但我知道这不一样，亚齐不一样。他的困惑货真价实——那不是我的错觉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"511001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-511001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-511001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"511001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-511001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-511001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-511001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-511001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在这个岛上，我鲜少有指导他人的机会，我不熟悉这个。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"511001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-511001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-511001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"511001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-511001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-511001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-511001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-511001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>……我也不知道。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>我感到后悔——这样的回答太敷衍了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>实际上，我当时明确想到了原因。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>我的母亲在我年幼时因病早逝，我只是……不想再体会第二次那种无能为力的感觉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"511011.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cb/HeadIconSmall-511011.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-511011.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"511011.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cb/HeadIconSmall-511011.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-511011.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cb/HeadIconSmall-511011.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-511011.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>……我总得做点什么，不论什么都好。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>我深呼吸了一口气，试图拉回破碎的思绪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"511001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-511001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-511001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"511001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-511001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-511001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-511001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-511001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>你说的是对的，亚齐，即使人做出努力也无法回避必将发生的结局。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"511001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-511001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-511001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"511001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-511001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-511001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-511001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-511001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>但我想，我们不能只是看着结果到来……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚齐：</div><div>……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>探寻的目光令我无所适从，于是试图模仿他们的方式去讲述。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"511001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-511001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-511001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"511001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-511001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-511001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-511001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-511001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>为即将到来的事物做准备，就像是……为早课准备诗篇。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"511001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-511001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-511001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"511001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-511001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-511001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-511001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-511001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>预先演习和熟悉将要面对的困难，至少能让我面对它的时候感到轻松一些……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>是的，我不常，或者说，我没有考虑意义的空隙。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>有时候，让人得以面对既定结局的品质不一定是勇气——也有可能是对真相的畏惧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>或许我注定遗忘那篇冗长的诗文，或许父亲，真的……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"511001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-511001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-511001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"511001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-511001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-511001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-511001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-511001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>……面对即将要发生的事，做些准备，总比不做准备要来得更好。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但鼓励他人，仍需要假借“勇气”的名义。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"511001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-511001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-511001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"511001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-511001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-511001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-511001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-511001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>如果桌子上的水瓶必将跌落在地上，那我会在周边的地上铺好棉垫，即使水瓶仍旧有可能破碎，但这么一来，残渣也会好收拾许多。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚齐：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>我侧头看向他。亚齐皱起眉头，似乎在思考我说的话。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"511001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-511001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-511001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"511001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-511001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-511001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-511001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-511001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>亚齐，其实你也并不想回答那个问题，对吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>我擅自揣测了他，这应当也是冒犯的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"511001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-511001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-511001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"511001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-511001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-511001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-511001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-511001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>我从37和其他学派内的兄弟姊妹那里听说过，那个“启示”……我不明白那具体是什么，但他们说，那是命运的赠礼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>就如同那道天上的声音，“启示”许诺给历代6有关世界的一切智慧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"511001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-511001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-511001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"511001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-511001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-511001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-511001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-511001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>可是……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>我试图将我感受到的一切说出来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"511001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-511001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-511001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"511001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-511001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-511001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-511001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-511001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>——你在畏惧它吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚齐：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚齐：</div><div>我不知道。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他的声音极轻，我几乎感觉这句话是我的幻觉，是段不存在的回忆。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚齐：</div><div>如果这天上的赠礼从未过问你的意志，也不关心你的存在，那么它还能称之为“赠礼”吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚齐：</div><div>——难道命运随手丢给我们一块肉骨头，我们就必须在它的脚边摇尾乞怜么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>亚齐的手轻微颤抖着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>我感到意外，我从未看到他如此激动的时候，更未想到他会说出如此激烈的言语。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>岛上的人们普遍因智慧而温和，210已是他们中的突出者。亚齐的话却比这更加尖锐。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>也许这才是他在那场辩论中未说出口的观念。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚齐：</div><div>……于是我只是背向那张桌子，不去考虑水瓶是否摇摇欲坠。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>亚齐最终看向了我手中的细沙。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚齐：</div><div>但我想你是对的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>我只记得在谈话的最后，他向我走来，脸上带着一些表情。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>那表情像是笑容，也像是愁苦，又好似释然，总之，那是一张下定了决心的脸。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_4_bg_haitan_zhou\"><img alt=\"1_4_bg_haitan_zhou\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png/600px-Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png/900px-Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png/1200px-Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚齐：</div><div>谢谢你对我说这么多，苏菲亚。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"511010.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-511010.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-511010.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"511010.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-511010.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-511010.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-511010.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-511010.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>也谢谢你愿意听我说这些话，亚齐。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>我们像是过去无数次一样地告别，不亲热，也不疏远。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>我返回我处于下坡的家，为我的父亲制作那枚派不上用场的镜片。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他返回他位于高坡上的家，回到现任“6”无上智慧的光芒照耀中去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"511001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-511001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-511001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"511001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-511001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-511001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-511001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-511001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"511010.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-511010.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-511010.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"511010.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-511010.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-511010.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-511010.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-511010.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>再见！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>我不知道我为什么要对亚齐告别。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚齐：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>而他只是回头，给予我一个颔首的示意。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在那之后，我再也没有见过亚齐在海滩上行走。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他开始了漫长的闭关。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "漫漫之夜行迹-02"}}